    "created_at": "2016-12-19T23:24:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-19T23:24:40Z",
    "body": "I think a PrintTable function would be necessary. If we were to, Node.js would probably print an ASCII table I imagine, which would necessitate having tabling logic... somewhere.\r\n\r\nWe *could* special-case Record types if we went that way, and just always have them print like that from Print, I think? I'm not 100% familiar on what those are though. (They may also be a bit problematic because our entire console is in JS and it would need to have a way to make them in a way that is exposed to JS, I think.)",
