    "created_at": "2025-04-04T15:00:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-04-04T15:00:01Z",
    "body": "It would be useful if the `properties` parameter could contain a nested path so that you can flatten fields.\n\n`[ \"a\", \"b.c\" ]` and `[ \"a\", [ \"b\", \"c\" ] ]` are syntaxes that I tried to invoke before reading the spec. (The former resulted in a blank second column; the latter resulted in `properties` being ignored completely.)\n\nSide note: it would be handy if the spec warning linked to this issue.",
